sequenceDiagram
    participant U as 👤 User's Browser
    participant KAINAM as KAINAM App (App Runner)
    participant Auth as Auth Service (ALB -> Keycloak)

    Note over U, KAINAM: Pre-condition: User is already logged in.<br/>Browser holds a valid JWT Access Token.

    U->>KAINAM: 1. API Request to /api/data with<br/> 'Authorization: Bearer <JWT>' header
    
    KAINAM->>Auth: 2. (On first call/cache miss) Backend fetches<br/> public key (JWKS) from Keycloak to verify JWT signature
    Auth-->>KAINAM: 3. Return public key
    
    Note left of KAINAM: 4. Backend validates the JWT signature,<br/> expiry, and claims.
    
    alt JWT is Valid
        Note left of KAINAM: Process request...
        KAINAM-->>U: 5. Return API data (e.g., 200 OK)
    else JWT is Invalid
        KAINAM-->>U: 5. Return error (e.g., 401 Unauthorized)
    end